# ==============================================================================
# TeaField Capture — Repository .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# Note: pubspec.lock should remain tracked for Flutter application build
# reproducibility when generated by `flutter pub get`.
# Note: .AI/ project documentation is intentionally tracked.

